VALET Desktop
==============

VALET Desktop is an independent desktop interface and CLI for the Lerd local
PHP development engine. It is not a reimplementation of the engine and does not
include the engine binary in this source repository.

Upstream engine
---------------

Lerd — Podman-powered local PHP development environment
